==========================================================================

Third-Party Components
==========================================================================

This project bundles, in `third_party/`, prebuilt artifacts (AAR/JAR and
native libraries) of AndroidTerminal (AT) Engine v0.4.4 (GAV 4.0.0),
built from AT source commit e2f2d7b (tag v0.4.4). The AT source code is
NOT included in this repository; only the prebuilt consumer artifacts are
vendored so the build is self-contained.

AndroidTerminal (AT)
    Copyright (C) 2024-2026 the AndroidTerminal contributors
    License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see root LICENSE for the full
    text; the AT project distributes the identical Apache-2.0 text).
    Upstream repository: the AndroidTerminal project (com.androidterminal).

The vendored AT artifacts include the native library `libadbd_engine.so`
(inside the `adb-engine` AAR), which statically links BoringSSL, a fork of
OpenSSL developed by Google.

