libc++_shared.so
    The LLVM/Clang C++ runtime shared library, built with the Android NDK
    (NDK r27, Clang 18.0.1).
    License: University of Illinois/NCSA MLL License (Apache-2.0 with
    LLVM exception) — https://llvm.org/LICENSE.txt

The ADB protocol implementations inside the AT artifacts are independent
implementations that reference AOSP protocol semantics documented in
source comments. No AOSP source code is distributed in this repository.
